cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its outputs, please cite it as below."
title: "Paper A reproduction package: Radiative Timescale Constraints on Boundary Layer Evolution in Models of Titan"
abstract: >-
  Code, single source of numbers, figures and tables of the revised version of
  "Radiative Timescale Constraints on Boundary Layer Evolution in Models of
  Titan" (Planetary and Space Science, PSS-D-26-00233). It contains a subset of
  the titan_pbl framework (configuration subsystem, vertical grid, model state
  and the gray radiation scheme with both surface longwave boundary
  conditions), the analyses of the archived output of Hartwick et al. (2026)
  and of Han and Lora (2025) that produce the numbers quoted in the text, and
  the scripts that regenerate and verify them.
type: software
